# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# One rule block per path pattern: a second `/*` block does not merge with the
# first, it replaces it. Everything for `/*` therefore lives together here.
#
# X-Robots-Tag keeps the staging deployment out of search results while the site
# runs on *.pages.dev without a domain. It MUST be removed on launch day: it is
# the GO LIVE GATE item "noindex ו-Discourage search engines הוסרו מהאתר החי",
# and it is listed in ROADMAP.md.
#
# HSTS is deliberately left out until the real domain is attached, because
# *.pages.dev is a hostname shared with every other Pages project.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
